@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = TOKEN_HIER_EINTRAGEN

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Systemstatus
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/status

### Startup Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/system/startup-check

### Login - Passwort/2FA je nach Account füllen
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "DEIN_USER",
  "password": "DEIN_PASSWORT",
  "totp": "123456"
}

### Security Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/security/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Module
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/modules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rechnungen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nummernkreis
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/number-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### LBD Vorschau
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/lbd/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Inventar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/inventory/devices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lager
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/warehouse/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aufgaben
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflow/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
